Package: mimar
Title: Compact Multiple Imputation, Assessment, and Reporting
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(person(given = "mimar", family = "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "maintainer@example.com"))
Author: mimar contributors
Maintainer: mimar contributors <maintainer@example.com>
Description: Provides a compact grammar for missing-data description, artificial missingness generation, single and multiple imputation, imputation evaluation, pooling, and diagnostic plotting. Machine-learning-based imputation can be performed through supported learners from the 'funcml' ecosystem, while keeping modeling operations internal to the imputation workflow.
